entries[147133] = { ["name"] = "Stormheart Tunic", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nChest Leather\n8 Armor\n+5 [Agility or Intellect]\n+7 Stamina\n+ 7 Critical Strike\n+ 3 Mastery\nDurability 165 / 165\nClasses: Druid\nStormheart Raiment (0/6)\nStormheart Tunic\nStormheart Drape\nStormheart Gloves\nStormheart Headdress\nStormheart Legguards\nStormheart Mantle\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Balance: Increase your maximum Astral Power by 30 and the critical strike damage of your Starsurge by 30%.\n(2) Set Feral: Gain 1 Energy each time Rip deals damage.\n(2) Set Guardian: The cooldown of Frenzied Regeneration is reduced by up to 40%, based on your current health when you use it. Cooldown is reduced more when used at lower health.\n(2) Set Restoration: The cooldown of Swiftmend is reduced by up to 40%, based on the current health of the target. Cooldown is reduced more when cast on a lower health target.\n(4) Set Balance: Starsurge and Starfall increase your Haste by 2% for 20 sec. Stacks up to 4 times, but gaining a stack does not refresh the duration.\n(4) Set Feral: Rip deals 10% increased damage and lasts 4 sec longer.\n(4) Set Guardian: The cooldown of Frenzied Regeneration is reduced by 1 sec for every 20 Rage you spend.\n(4) Set Restoration: Swiftmend increases your Efflorescence healing by 200% for 10 sec.\nSell Price:" }
