entries[147151] = { ["name"] = "Xuen's Tunic", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nChest Leather\n8 Armor\n+5 [Agility or Intellect]\n+7 Stamina\n+ 6 Critical Strike\n+ 4 Haste\nDurability 165 / 165\nClasses: Monk\nXuen's Battlegear (0/6)\nXuen's Tunic\nXuen's Cloak\nXuen's Gauntlets\nXuen's Helm\nXuen's Legguards\nXuen's Shoulderguards\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Brewmaster: Consuming a brew has a 40% chance to generate a Gift of the Ox Healing Sphere. (Proc chance: 40%)\n(2) Set Windwalker: Rising Sun Kick critical strikes reduce the cooldown of Fists of Fury by 1.5 sec.\n(2) Set Mistweaver: Essence Font has a 40% chance to grant Surge of Mists, reducing the cost of your next Enveloping Mist by 75%. (Proc chance: 40%)\n(4) Set Brewmaster: When a Gift of the Ox Healing Sphere is consumed, your current Stagger amount is lowered by 5%.\n(4) Set Windwalker: When Fists of Fury ends, the critical strike chance of Rising Sun Kick is increased by 30% for 5 sec.\n(4) Set Mistweaver: When you consume Surge of Mist, your healing done is increased by 12% for 10 sec.\nSell Price:" }
