entries[147163] = { ["name"] = "Shawl of Blind Absolution", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nBack\n3 Armor\n+3 [Agility or Strength or Intellect]\n+4 Stamina\n+ 3 Critical Strike\n+ 2 Mastery\nClasses: Priest\nVestments of Blind Absolution (0/6)\nShawl of Blind Absolution\nGloves of Blind Absolution\nHood of Blind Absolution\nLeggings of Blind Absolution\nRobes of Blind Absolution\nMantle of Blind Absolution\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Discipline: The first bolt of light from your Penance deals an additional 65% damage or heals for an additional 65%.\n(2) Set Holy: Serendipity reduces the cooldown of your Holy Words by up to an additional 1.0 sec.\n(2) Set Shadow: Mind Flay damage increases the damage of your next Mind Blast by 3% and its Insanity generation by 1. Stacks up to 10 times.\n(4) Set Discipline: Power Word: Shield has a 15% chance to cause your next Penance to be free and have 50% reduced cooldown. (Proc chance: 15%)\n(4) Set Holy: Your Holy Words have a 40% chance to trigger a 50% reduced cooldown. (Proc chance: 40%)\n(4) Set Shadow: Insanity drains 10% slower while in Voidform.\nSell Price:" }
