entries[147175] = { ["name"] = "Harness of the Skybreaker", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nChest Mail\n12 Armor\n+5 [Agility or Intellect]\n+7 Stamina\n+ 7 Haste\n+ 3 Versatility\nDurability 165 / 165\nClasses: Shaman\nRegalia of the Skybreaker (0/6)\nHarness of the Skybreaker\nDrape of the Skybreaker\nGrips of the Skybreaker\nHelmet of the Skybreaker\nLegguards of the Skybreaker\nPauldrons of the Skybreaker\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Elemental: Reduce the cooldown of [ Storm Elemental / Fire Elemental] by [ Storm Elemental : 0.5 / 1.0] sec when Flame Shock periodic damage deals a critical strike. This effect may occur once every 1.0 sec. (1s cooldown)\n(2) Set Enhancement: Crash Lightning increases your critical strike chance by 5% for 16 sec.\n(2) Set Restoration: Your healing spells have a chance to increase the Critical Strike chance of your next Riptide by 100%.\n(4) Set Elemental: While [ Storm Elemental / Fire Elemental] is active, your Flame Shock deals 5% increased damage over time and always critically strikes.\n(4) Set Enhancement: Stormstrike increases the initial damage of your next Crash Lightning by 35%, stacking up to 15 times.\n(4) Set Restoration: When Riptide's initial heal critically strikes, the healing done by your next Healing Rain is increased by 50%.\nSell Price:" }
