entries[147187] = { ["name"] = "Titanic Onslaught Breastplate", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nChest Plate\n18 Armor\n+5 [Strength or Intellect]\n+7 Stamina\n+ 7 Haste\n+ 3 Mastery\nDurability 165 / 165\nClasses: Warrior\nTitanic Onslaught Armor (0/6)\nTitanic Onslaught Breastplate\nTitanic Onslaught Cloak\nTitanic Onslaught Handguards\nTitanic Onslaught Greathelm\nTitanic Onslaught Greaves\nTitanic Onslaught Pauldrons\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Arms: Colossus Smash reduces the cooldown of Bladestorm by 3.0 sec.\n(2) Set Fury: Bloodthirst critical strikes have a 50% chance to grant you Raging Thirst, increasing the damage of your Raging Blow by 50% for 8 sec. (Proc chance: 50%)\n(2) Set Protection: Berserker Rage instantly generates 20 Rage and an additional 10 Rage every 1 sec for 6 sec.\n(4) Set Arms: While Bladestorm is active, you automatically cast a total of 2 Mortal Strikes at random nearby enemies.\n(4) Set Fury: Raging Blow increases the damage and healing of your next Bloodthirst by [ Inner Rage : 50%, stacking up to 10 times / 20%, stacking up to 10 times].\n(4) Set Protection: Shield Slam reduces the cooldown of Berserker Rage by 3.0 sec.\nSell Price:" }
